cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use synfit in research, please cite it as below, and cite the primary references for the synergy scores you report (see README)."
title: synfit
abstract: >-
  Dose-response curve fitting (Hill equation, 4- and 5-parameter) and
  drug-combination synergy scoring (Bliss, HSA, Loewe, ZIP) for pharmacology,
  with explicit noise models and direction-neutral parameters for inhibition
  and activation assays.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sarikas
    given-names: Srdjan
    email: develop@synfit.app
version: 0.8.0
date-released: "2026-10-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/szarma/synfit"
url: "https://synfit.app"
keywords:
  - pharmacology
  - dose-response
  - hill-equation
  - ic50
  - ec50
  - drug-synergy
  - bliss-independence
  - loewe-additivity
  - zip-synergy
  - curve-fitting
